WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:05,100
Population. I will go back tomorrow and arrest people immediately.

2
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,620
Do you want me to leave some people to guard you?

3
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:12,420
I'll make you dizzy a few more times

4
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:19,760
You don't need to worry about it. I'll handle it myself later.

5
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:30,980
Add another lock here to get in quickly

6
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:42,180
Just ask for a lock to be removed
